# Scarlet SMP bot-only kit command. Install Skript on the Minecraft server.\n# Save as plugins/Skript/scripts/ScarletBot_Loadout.sk\ncommand /sm27:\n    trigger:\n        if name of player is not "ShadowMiner27":\n            stop\n        give player 1 netherite helmet\n        give player 1 netherite chestplate\n        give player 1 netherite leggings\n        give player 1 netherite boots\n        give player 1 netherite sword\n        give player 1 netherite pickaxe\n        give player 1 netherite axe\n        give player 1 bow\n        give player 64 arrows\n        give player 1 shield\n        give player 3 totem of undying\n        give player 64 cooked beef\n        give player 16 golden apples\n        give player 16 ender pearls\n        send "&cScarlet SMP &7| Bot kit given." to player\n